en_core_web_sm — spaCy English pipeline
=======================================

`model.json` and `model.safetensors` in this directory are an exported form of
spaCy's `en_core_web_sm` trained pipeline, embedded into the binary so
dependency parsing, OpenIE, CATENA causal/temporal extraction, appositive alias
minting and entity canonicalization work with no download and no network.

