Export format
-------------

These are NOT the upstream spaCy distribution files. They are an export
consumable by `crates/spacy-rusty`, an independent reimplementation of spaCy's
inference pipeline:

  - `model.json`        vocab, tokenizer exceptions, lemmatizer rules,
                        layer shapes and labels
  - `model.safetensors` layer weights

`vectors_key2row.json` is absent because `en_core_web_sm` ships no static word
vectors. The loader treats it as optional.

No spaCy or Thinc source code is included. Numerical inference behaviour was
matched against spaCy's public releases using golden fixtures generated from
spaCy itself; see `tests/dep_parser_parity.rs`.
